1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,673
MIA: You're BROKE, Zane! We're DONE!

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,991
TYLER: Sorry, bro. She needs a real king... not a guy with zero Robux.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,844
ZANE: Okay. Enjoy your new king.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,974
MIA: Ugh. Loser.

5
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:19,438
MIA: Babe, you promised me VIP at the Crown Gala tonight!

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,844
TYLER: Relax. I'm literally on the list.

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:29,406
BOUNCER: Tyler? You're off the list. The owner removed you... personally.

8
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,323
TYLER: The owner?! Who even owns this place?

9
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:37,964
ZANE: I do.

10
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,741
MIA: Zane?! You're... RICH?!

11
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:49,761
ZANE: I own the whole server, Mia. I just wanted someone who liked me... not my Robux.

12
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,924
MIA: Babe, I'm so sorry! I'll dump Tyler right now!

13
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:58,532
TYLER: Mia... I work for him. That was a loyalty test.

14
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,701
ZANE: And you failed it... on day one.

15
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,931
MIA: Zane, WAIT!

